## PR Title
Make some changes on FSM to ensure synchronous read and write for inferred RAM

## PR Description
No formal description was provided by the contributor. The PR adjusts the FSM to issue synchronous reads and writes so that the on-chip memory is correctly inferred as block RAM. 15 commits cover initial FSM synchronization changes, timing fixes that re-enable the loop PoC, VCD output corrections, testbench fixes, svlint compliance, memory-map cleanup, and support for clocked memory reads in simulation. The PR also splits memory into byte lanes to make byte-granularity writes synthesize cleanly.

